{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q24.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面材料并回答问题。材料一：李自成是明末农民军最杰出的领袖。崇祯十七年（1644年）正月，李自成在西安建国，国号大顺，建元永昌。…农民军以疾风暴雨之势，从陕西经山西直捣北京。三月十七日，农民军已至北京城下。…十九日晨，崇祯帝在煤山自缢而死。农民军胜利地开进北京。--摘自翦伯赞《中国史钢要》材料二：崇祯十二年（1639年），张献忠叛乱…李自成也乘时猖獗，于十四年（1641年）攻陷河南……十六年（1643年），李自成陷裏旧，僭号“新顺王”。次年，李自成建国，号曰大顺，改元永昌…这时洪承畴早为清军所俘，山海关之地全部沦陷，而流寇的势力已非明朝所能抵御。就在这一年，流寇攻陷北京，清军也接着入关。--摘自傅乐成《中国通史》", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3124, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3436, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q24"], "word_count": 312, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3124, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3436, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "38a4a9c4