{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q25.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面材料并回答问题。材料：下面是某历史教学法教材在论述课文辅助系统时所用的案例图1-30辛亥革命形势图结合地图，归纳一下武昌起义发生的有利条件。①从地理位置看。②从经济发展看。③从革命基础看。此外，你认为还有哪些因素？如四川保路运动的影响。数数看，到1911年，共有多少省份宣布独立？它们主要集中在哪些地区？", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3499, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3655, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q25"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q25"], "word_count": 156, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3499, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3655, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization