{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q26.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面材料并回答问题。材料：下面是某教师为“中华人民共和国的成立”一课设计的学生自主学习环节。（1）个体学习：阅读课文学案中的材料，完成学案的基础知识题。（2）小组交流：围绕中华人民共和国成立的相关知识分组进行交流。（3）合作探究：结合学案中的材料，如人民英雄纪念碑的碑文、《共同纲领》的内容、图片《开国大典》、国旗、国歌等，以“中国人民从此站起来了”为主题，进行活动、发表感想。（4）总结提升。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3712, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3911, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 26, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q26"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s2.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.310.r008", "ntce.outline.310.r009", "ntce.outline.310.r010", "ntce.outline.310.r012", "ntce.outline.316.r010", "ntce.outline.316.r017"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2019a.q26"], "word_count": 199, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "38a4a9c46cc3498b1a7596e65e8e166952595766182dce65dbe03077383cc100", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3712, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3911, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题.csv", "role": "q